\"destination account\">ACC-407</td><td class=\"px-3 py-3.5 mono text-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-4-6\" data-name=\"amount\">₹31,200</td><td class=\"px-3 py-3.5 text-[var(--soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-4-7\" data-name=\"channel\">UPI</td><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 mono text-right text-[var(--orange)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-4-8\" data-name=\"destination score\">54</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"border-b border-[var(--line-soft)] hover:bg-[#151e28]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-5\" data-name=\"transaction row 5 (ATM)\"><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 mono text-[var(--mute)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"hop number\">5</td><td class=\"px-3 py-3.5 mono text-[var(--soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"transaction ID\">TXN-2026-041-0121</td><td class=\"px-3 py-3.5 mono whitespace-nowrap\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-5-3\" data-name=\"timestamp\">19 Jun · 11:41</td><td class=\"px-3 py-3.5 mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-5-4\" data-name=\"source account\">ACC-209</td><td class=\"px-3 py-3.5 mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-5-5\" data-name=\"destination ATM\">ATM-09</td><td class=\"px-3 py-3.5 mono text-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-5-6\" data-name=\"amount\">₹22,000</td><td class=\"px-3 py-3.5 text-[var(--soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-5-7\" data-name=\"channel\">ATM</td><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 mono text-right text-[var(--mute)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-5-8\" data-name=\"destination score false\">—</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"hover:bg-[#151e28]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-6\" data-name=\"transaction row 6 (loop)\"><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 mono text-[var(--mute)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-6-1\" data-name=\"hop number\">6</td><td class=\"px-3 py-3.5 mono text-[var(--soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-6-2\" data-name=\"transaction ID\">TXN-2026-041-0128</td><td class=\"px-3 py-3.5 mono whitespace-nowrap\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-6-3\" data-name=\"timestamp\">20 Jun · 10:06</td><td class=\"px-3 py-3.5 mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-6-4\" data-name=\"source account\">ACC-407</td><td class=\"px-3 py-3.5 mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-6-5\" data-name=\"destination account\">ACC-209 <span class=\"text-[var(--mute)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-6-5-1\" data-name=\"loop annotation\">(loop)</span></td><td class=\"px-3 py-3.5 mono text-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-6-6\" data-name=\"amount\">₹18,600</td><td class=\"px-3 py-3.5 text-[var(--soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-6-7\" data-name=\"channel\">UPI</td><td class=\"px-5 py-3.5 mono text-right text-[var(--red)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2-6-8\" data-name=\"destination score\">88</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"px-5 py-3 border-t border-[var(--line)] flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-[var(--mute)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-3\" data-name=\"register footer notes\"><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-3-1\" data-name=\"audit trail note\">Transaction IDs and timestamps are retained for checking against source records.</span><span class=\"mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-3-2\" data-name=\"time window display\">Window: 18 Jun 09:12 → 18 Jul 09:12 2026</span></div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-[var(--mute)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5\" data-name=\"page bottom action bar\"><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"triage disclaimer text\">No account action is taken from this view. Review supporting records before triage.</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2\" data-name=\"action links group\"><a class=\"text-[var(--soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"open account link\" href=\"#\">Open account</a><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"link separator\">·</span><a class=\"text-[var(--soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3\" data-name=\"print evidence report link\" href=\"#\">Print evidence report</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</main>\n</div>",
